Thank you for contacting the American Red Cross. &nbsp;Following the shoting on Oct 1, the American Red Cross provided more than 250 additional blood products to local hospitals to help those injured. &nbsp;We stand ready to provide blood and blood products as needed in response to this tragedy.<br />
<br />
We are always welcoming new sponosrs and hope that your organization will decide to be an ongoing sponsor. &nbsp;Currently our schedule for the next severals weeks is filled with committed organizations sponsoring blood drives. &nbsp;However, we are in need of blood drive sponsors for Late November, December and January. &nbsp;<br />
<br />
By having committed blood drive sponsor sign up now for future blood drive dates we will ensure that we have adequate blood supply in both emergency and non-emergency times.<br />
<br />
For those that would like to help now, please have them visit www.redcrossblood.org to make an appointment to donate at one of our many blood drives in the Metro Atlanta Area/Georgia area. &nbsp;<br />
<br />
Please let me know if your organization would consider helping in the months of November, December or January. &nbsp;We truly appreciate your willingness to help and support the American Red Cross Blood Program.<br />
<br />
Best Regards,<br />
